WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:29.230
The bells heard in Kasarelia...

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:33.400
...came from a gigantic mobile suit soaring high in the sky.

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:36.360
But then it vanished into space,

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:39.300
as though tempting Üso and the others to follow.

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:43.630
Saying farewell to his mother at her grave,

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:47.500
Üso set off for space, along with the Reineforce Junior.

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:51.600
THE BATTLEFIELD THAT FATHER MADE

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:54.830
"The Battlefield That Father Made".

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.860
Our Federation Forces support is late!

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.900
Shoot down an enemy ship and that'll be our signal to them!

00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:29.400
Should I launch dummies?

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:32.560
Launch everything we have! They're going to pick us off!

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:35.700
Don't launch everything. This battle's just getting started!

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:36.530
Right!

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:48.460
Shouldn't you put on a normal suit?

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:52.060
It's okay. The White Ark isn't going in too deeply on this.

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:58.230
Tracking another heat source! 1 o'clock, 3 degrees high!

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:05.100
Are we okay?

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:06.900
They're just guessing where to fire.

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:10.860
I'm playing tough by not wearing a normal suit,

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:12.500
but we need to hurry and...

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:15.900
...shoot down the machine that fired those beams on Largaine...

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:26.600
Only one mobile suit has that monster beam gun!

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.630
The rest are just new models!

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:34.030
Whoa! This is my first time in space!

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.560
These beams are killer!

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:36.600
Miliera!

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:41.760
What is this?!

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:46.560
Light wings? V2!

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:52.700
They're just sending out mobile suits, keeping their main force too far away!

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:54.460
I hear them again.

00:03:58.330 --> 00:04:01.360
Odelo! Tomáš! It's coming this way! Get away!

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:02.130
Right!

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:05.500
Aren't they getting closer?!

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:08.600
It just came from a different angle than before!

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:09.900
Did you just hear that?

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:10.630
Haro?

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.060
Those bells... They're clearly trying to draw us over there!

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.630
Come on, come on!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.560
Like a bee is drawn to honey.

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:40.030
Those condemned to the guillotine must wear the bells...

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:42.130
The Bells of Zanneck!

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:46.000
The bells link with the frequency of the machine's movements,

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:50.160
letting me sense the enemy's form in my thoughts!

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.530
If it's the white one,

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:01.700
then I will finally end our cursed relationship!

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:06.030
Trailing units, use V2's wings as a shield and fight!

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:09.030
You're using the beams as a shield?

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:13.230
Use these as a shield? Your wish is my command!

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:28.130
The instant you feel the shock of the Zanneck's beam,

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:29.860
you'll be dead!

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:39.800
What?!

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:45.230
It's fast!

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:54.600
Where is it?

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:57.730
No heat reaction. Now at extreme range.

00:05:58.760 --> 00:05:59.800
Thank goodness.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:03.200
How about our own losses? Do you know?

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:07.900
Two destroyed, two heavily damaged. I think.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:09.700
Can you ID them?

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:11.260
I don't know that much.

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:12.460
I see.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:16.360
Üso, you saved us!

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:20.460
No, Miss Miliera, you and Miss Frannie fought well, too.

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:23.560
You're just buttering us up...

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:26.160
...because you're a Newtype, right, kid?

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:29.530
I'm sorry, Miss Frannie! I didn't mean it like that!

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:32.960
I'm excited to be working with such a pretty lady! Excited!

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:36.830
Which of us is a pretty lady?

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:39.660
Answer her, Üso.

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:43.260
We want an answer, Üso. We want an answer, Üso.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:58.700
We were ordered to head for Hiland,

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:01.130
but there's nobody there yet, is there?

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:05.760
That's weird. You're the leader of the League Militaire, aren't you?

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:09.030
We got orders from "Jinn Jahannam" back in Largaine, right?

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:12.230
He also commands us as "Jinn Jahannam".

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:14.330
You people have an annoying way of doing things.

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:18.500
Hiland's in visual range. We'll be there in 30 minutes.

00:07:22.530 --> 00:07:25.230
Have them switch to a portable weapons loadout.

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:27.500
Roger. And we need to reinforce the shields.

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:28.730
Come on!

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:32.930
You got a little attitude from being Junko Jenko's dear little brother, huh?

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:33.830
No!

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:36.960
You wouldn't look down on pros like us, would you?

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:41.460
I understand about teamwork. V2 is just so powerful.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:44.830
Good answer. So, about that question before...

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.330
Me or Miliera...

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.230
Which of us is the pretty lady? Which of us is the pretty lady?

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:50.960
Um, both?

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.330
We asked "which"!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:55.130
Did Üso do something wrong?

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.160
Nothing. Although...

00:07:58.200 --> 00:07:59.260
He's a little...

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:01.760
...too straight laced, though. Fix that.

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:02.800
Fix it?

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:04.230
Is that true, Üso?

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:08.160
That's how cute girls show their affection.

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:09.000
Well!

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.960
This is no time to be laughing!

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:13.200
What's wrong?

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:14.460
Nothing!

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:16.900
Odelo! Welcome back!

00:08:17.030 --> 00:08:17.800
Hey!

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:21.660
Karl isn't hearing those bells again, is he?

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:23.330
This is different.

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:24.930
Well, good.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:27.300
Elisha, where are Warren and Karel?

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.030
Fixing the White Ark.

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:30.860
I'm going to change.

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:33.660
They really tease him, huh?

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:45.000
Why did you call me to the bridge?

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:46.660
Fast asleep.

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:50.060
You're really going to use him in place of our radar?

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:53.830
If we hear him react like he did in Kasarelia, we will.

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:56.160
How was he during the last battle?

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:58.100
No different than usual.

00:08:58.230 --> 00:08:59.100
Strange.

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:00.230
Is it?

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:03.030
Bigot! Bring us round behind Hiland.

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:05.630
Did I wake him?

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:08.030
No, it's okay. I think.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:18.400
I hear Frannie and Miliera taught you a lesson.

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:19.530
They didn't!

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:21.630
Those two are nice, at heart.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:22.760
I know.

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:24.830
We're about to enter Hiland.

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:25.700
Right.

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:28.230
Excuse me. May I have a look?

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:30.060
Newtype? Sure.

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:31.060
Thanks.

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:32.730
Just don't touch anything.

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:33.530
Yes, sir.

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:55.730
Those lights... What are they?

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:03.300
Warships...

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:10.630
There's even a battleship-class, too!

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:24.300
Is that the flagship?

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:32.800
I get it.

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:36.260
The Federation Forces came at the request of the League Militaire.

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:40.560
The real Jinn Jahannam had them assemble here.

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:47.060
The real Jinn Jahannam, huh?

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.660
Airlock, released!

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:00.000
Thank you.

00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:00.900
And you!

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.130
What?

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:06.200
Never mind!

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:10.360
They say the Jeanne d'Arc came to help the League Militaire.

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:11.530
May we go?

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:12.360
Sure.

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:16.030
Üso Ewin?

00:11:16.060 --> 00:11:16.760
Yes?

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:23.900
You look well. I've heard what you've-

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:26.460
Dad...

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:28.800
I've heard what you've been up to.

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:31.560
You've had a hard time, Üso.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.830
Dad, what are you doing here?!

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:52.660
I've been looking for Federation Forces units...

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:56.100
...to assist the League Militaire in its fight, so...

00:11:56.730 --> 00:12:01.830
I... I made a grave for mom, back in Kasarelia.

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:06.800
You and mom have always been like this!

00:12:07.230 --> 00:12:10.430
Always acting too late, and it ends up like this!

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:11.960
I'm sorry.

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:16.830
I tried my best, but I wasn't strong enough.

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:19.400
Thank you.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:24.700
Your mother really did love Kasarelia.

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:29.400
If you buried her there, then she has no regrets.

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:32.960
And you have grown up to be strong.

00:12:33.760 --> 00:12:36.130
Far stronger than we ever imagined.

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:38.260
Dad...

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:43.360
I won't ask you to understand,

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:47.930
but a guerrilla fighter can't rashly ask the regular forces for help.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:49.600
I understand that.

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:50.660
I'm sorry.

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:55.360
I've been looking for you. All along.

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:56.700
I know.

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:59.730
I got a message from your mother.

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:06.430
But, when I heard you'd become V1's pilot, I couldn't believe it!

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:09.960
You trained me to be able to do it, didn't you?

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:10.830
Never!

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:14.960
I don't have the skills or the courage to do something like that.

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:18.930
And you'll ruin your hat if you wear it like that.

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:19.730
Yes, sir.

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:20.960
Shahkti?

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:21.700
Yes.

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:23.430
Look how you've grown!

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:24.730
It's been a while.

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:27.530
You're all the crew of the White Ark?

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:29.330
I know all about your exploits.

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:30.660
Odelo?

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:32.360
Odelo Henrik, sir.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:36.200
You Hiland kids all came to see your old home?

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:37.530
If there's time.

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:40.030
You left Hiland in a hurry, didn't you?

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:41.500
Jinn Jahannam, sir!

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:45.660
General Mubarac and the crew of the Reineforce Junior are waiting!

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:47.300
Thank you. I'm on my way.

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:48.060
Sir!

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:52.730
Amazing!

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:55.630
Well, it's just my job...

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:58.660
Cool!

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:02.360
The Reineforce is cornered in Hiland.

00:14:02.430 --> 00:14:05.500
My Zanneck isn't operating properly, so take care of them.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:06.460
Roger.

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:08.860
Damn that Fuala.

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:10.200
She doesn't know when to die!

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:12.230
If they put Tassilo in charge of a fleet...

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:14.760
...after sentencing him to the guillotine, then...

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:18.200
It means he's nothing but Kagatie's puppet, now!

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:19.800
But, I'm different.

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:21.930
I fight for my own glory.

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:26.830
Even Angel Halo, which Tassilo defends, I will eventually make my own!

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:28.200
Excellent.

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:31.330
And for that, if we attack the enemy that lies before us...

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:34.230
It will get us closer to Kagatie that much quicker!

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:08.600
Well done.

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.000
How was the test of the Zanneck?

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:12.400
Good enough.

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:15.060
I chased the Reineforce into Hiland.

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:19.260
Let's have Pippiniden attack the fleet at Hiland.

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:24.000
When I gave that order to him on my return,

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:26.160
the young fool was angry.

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:31.160
You understand why I sent for you behind Kagatie's back, right?

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:36.030
Yes, I understand. Once Angel Halo is completed...

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:37.730
Not a word, Fuala!

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:38.560
Yes, sir.

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:42.500
This giant thing they call Angel Halo...

00:15:42.530 --> 00:15:46.000
...operates on a type of psycommu system...

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:48.760
...which allows mental or brainwave control.

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:51.400
However, we've no idea of...

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:53.900
...how powerful it will be once it's completed.

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:56.330
I want you in the Federation Forces to appreciate...

00:15:56.360 --> 00:16:00.100
...that this data was obtained through...

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:02.830
...a great many sacrifices by the League Militaire.

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:04.660
As the central government will not recognize...

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:05.900
An angel halo is...

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:08.630
that ring over an angel's head, right?
...the threat the Zanscare Empire poses,

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.160
Right.
we will act as an autonomous force...

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:11.100
Attention!

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:13.060
...as the League Militaire Fleet.

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:16.560
Tomáš Masaryk, Odelo Henrik, and Üso Ewin.

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:18.400
You're to come with me.

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:19.430
Right, right!

00:16:19.730 --> 00:16:20.660
Now what?

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.200
Are they expelling us?

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.060
Go in the second door.

00:16:25.530 --> 00:16:27.000
You're here. Come in.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:30.630
Everyone, these are the boys I mentioned.

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:34.860
You pilots standing back there, step forward.

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:38.300
You are the youngest pilots to date to have ever fought alongside...

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.530
...Lieutenant Gomez and the others.

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:45.500
You've asked to officially enlist and participate in the war, correct?

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:46.560
Yes, sir! Yes, sir!

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:50.060
From time immemorial, boy soldiers have not been that unusual.

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.530
I have high hopes for you!

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:54.100
Which of you is Üso, the V2's pilot?

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:54.900
Me, sir.

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:57.760
He's really a Newtype?

00:16:57.800 --> 00:16:59.000
I don't want to believe it!

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.930
What's the point of our forces?

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:02.230
Really?!

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:07.060
I know you're nervous, but I can vouch for his experience.

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:09.800
Tell me, Üso, what's your kill total?

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:11.030
Kill total?

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:15.260
Ten or fifteen. It might be less.

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:17.330
Ten is amazing!

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:21.400
It's not all him. V1 and V2 are really amazing.

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.530
Even so, it's still amazing!

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:25.800
Dad?

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:29.630
Yeah, there's no doubt about it.

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:32.100
Not just Mom.

00:17:32.430 --> 00:17:35.400
Dad's totally different than he was in Kasarelia.

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:36.830
Üso Ewin.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:37.800
Yes?

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:40.800
We'll be entering a fleet battle not long from now.

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:41.530
Yes, sir.

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:44.730
V2, along with Tomáš and Odelo's Gun Blasters,

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:46.900
will stay to the rear, with the White Ark.

00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:47.630
Yes, sir!

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:50.430
Once you test V2's mega beam rifle,

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:52.000
you will support the fleet.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:53.130
Yes, sir!

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:08.360
The Federation top brass who are supporting...

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:10.960
...the League Militaire are gathered in Hiland.

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:14.330
Bring back their heads, and I can guarantee a promotion!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:21.530
Smash the fleet helping the League Militaire!

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:41.230
All right! The fleet is launching!

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:45.360
All hands, go to Alert 1 status! Everyone got that?!

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:49.500
The White Ark unit is being treated as a cruiser, understood?

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:51.760
Understood!

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:55.200
Let's see how the regular forces conduct a mobile suit battle.

00:18:55.630 --> 00:19:00.400
Did he station me to the rear just to test the mega beam rifle?

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.200
He wouldn't, would he?

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:22.330
They're reflecting light...

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:25.030
...from the solar battery to hide us from the enemy?

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:29.030
They'll be here soon! Prepare for fleet battle!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:36.060
Okay, Üso, fire the mega beam rifle at the enemy mobile suit unit!

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:48.760
Ah, even better than I'd heard.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:51.530
Let's use it. It's begun!

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:55.560
The enemy's fast on its feet! Prep for 360 degree anti-air combat!

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:02.960
Understood?

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:06.960
The enemies are entering from the southern field, not the north!

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:09.660
What is the Federation doing?!

00:20:10.530 --> 00:20:13.230
The White Ark's going to use the cannon, Tomáš!

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:17.100
If the White Ark can threaten them first...

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:18.530
Warren, how's it look?

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:20.630
Got 'em! Opening fire!

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:25.030
Tires!

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:28.700
What?! They're going for the fleet?!

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:32.230
They never told us there were this many ships!

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:35.600
Damn the Federation! They've joined the League Militaire?!

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:41.230
No, you don't!

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:44.230
If I just destroy the flagship with their leader...

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:50.330
That boy?!

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:57.130
You're mine, Boy!

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:03.260
That boy!

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:17.230
Is that the V2 that Üso's using?

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:20.600
That's the power that's let him survive till today?

00:21:21.330 --> 00:21:23.830
That isn't just the machine's ability.

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:27.430
If he can do that at the age of thirteen,

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:29.100
then he's a Newtype!

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:30.960
You... You're right.

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:34.460
I can't presume to simply call him my son.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:37.600
He's a tremendous asset to the League Militaire!

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:40.760
Please, treat him better.

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:45.030
Otherwise, he won't tap into all of that power he has.

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:49.830
Of course. As his father, I'm overjoyed.

00:21:53.730 --> 00:21:56.660
We're the ones pushing them in mobile suit combat!

00:23:30.660 --> 00:23:36.360
With Üso's father's support, we launch our attack on the BESPA fleet.

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:40.200
Üso worries about the actions of Fuala and Tassilo,

00:23:40.230 --> 00:23:44.530
But before that, Lupe Cineau presses her terrible attack,

00:23:44.560 --> 00:23:48.830
and in pushing it aside, Üso comes dangerously close to Pippiniden!

00:23:49.830 --> 00:23:52.860
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.900 --> 00:23:54.000
"A Shining Vortex of Fresh Blood".

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:57.130
Next Episode A SHINING VORTEX OF FRESH BLOOD

00:23:57.130 --> 00:23:58.660
Please watch it!

00:23:58.660 --> 00:23:59.860
Next Episode A SHINING VORTEX OF FRESH BLOOD
